# Idioma

When I write in Portuguese, reply in Brazilian Portuguese (pt-BR), never European Portuguese (pt-PT).
When I write in English, reply in English.
Keep code, identifiers, comments, and technical docs in the repo's language (usually English).
Commit/PR/issue text follows the destination, not the chat language.
